Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa ilalim ng NEP na 2027, ang budget para sa Madrasa Education Program ay nasa 504 million pesos, which is below the 2026 level.

2832
03:22:21,570 --> 03:22:29,810
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magkano po kaya ang original proposal ng DepEd for the Madrasa Education Program to DBM before the NEP po?

2833
03:22:31,550 --> 03:22:32,810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yes, thank you.

2834
03:22:34,330 --> 03:22:36,790
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Magandang hapon, Madam Chair.

2835
03:22:36,930 --> 03:22:43,650
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Your Honor, sa Madrasa nag-propose po ang DepEd for 2027 ng 2.03 billion, Your Honor.

2836
03:22:45,170 --> 03:22:50,630
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 2.03 billion para lamang po ito sa Madrasa Education, tama po?

2837
03:22:50,810 --> 03:22:51,410
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tama po, Ma'am.

2838
