DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This is for the...

2840
03:23:17,140 --> 03:23:20,560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: increase in subsidy and additional asset needs.

2841
03:23:21,160 --> 03:23:29,340
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung compensation po ng 670 asset needs handling the Alive classes, the Arabic language classes, Your Honor.

2842
03:23:29,340 --> 03:23:33,880
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, ibig sabihin po, malaki po yung matatapyas sa kanila.

2843
03:23:35,000 --> 03:23:45,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Chair, Mr. Secretary, sa fiscal year of 2027 allocation, ilang learners at asset needs ang kayang masuportahan?

2844
03:23:45,340 --> 03:23:45,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Masuportahan.

2845
03:23:47,140 --> 03:23:48,940
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: 2026 or 2027, ho?

2846
03:23:48,960 --> 03:23:51,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 2027, po. Allocation.

2847
03:23:54,090 --> 03:24:02,010
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan yung may plantilla items at magkano ang magiging compensation para sa mga asatids kada buwan?

2848
03:24:02,710 --> 03:24:05,010
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Your Honor, 2,906, po.

2849
03:24:09,140 --> 03:24:13,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At nasa magkano naman po kaya ang magiging compensation ng asatids kada buwan?

2850
03:24:15,940 --> 03:24:18,700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: 12,500, Your Honor.

2851
03:24:19,100 --> 03:24:24,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito po ba ay kapareho lamang ng 2026?

2852
03:24:25,720 --> 03:24:28,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Current year or mas bumaba, po?

2853
03:24:29,740 --> 03:24:30,600
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Parehas lang, ho.

2854
03:24:30,840 --> 03:24:31,960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Parehas lang, po. Okay.

2855
03:24:32,860 --> 03:24:39,680
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Chair, in the proper time, Akbayan will push to increase the budget for the Madrasa Education Program.

2856
03:24:39,680 --> 03:24:47,280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa buong taong pakikipag-usap ko po sa ating Moro community sa kanilang pag-rehabilitate ng Madrasa schools,

2857
03:24:47,780 --> 03:24:55,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: mahalagang hindi maiiwan ang Madrasa system, which is important and integral to Muslim Filipinos.

2858
03:24:55,720 --> 03:24:58,200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako naman po ako sa IPED.

2859
03:24:58,740 --> 03:25:12,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mula sa 154 million sa gaan ng 2026, ay bumagsak po ito sa 76 million ang pondo para sa Indigenous People's Education sa NEP ng 2027.

2860
03:25:13,660 --> 03:25:21,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Chair, Mr. Secretary, bakit po kaya bumaba ng higit kalahati ang item natin sa IPED?

2861
03:25:21,820 --> 03:25:24,820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mula 154 million sa gaan ng 2026.

2862
03:25:25,720 --> 03:25:29,360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Iking 76 million na lang sa NEP ng 2027.

2863
03:25:30,740 --> 03:25:38,300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kung ikukumpara po sa NEP ng 2026, 74.8 million ang NEP noong 2026.

2864
03:25:38,820 --> 03:25:46,240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Dinagdagan po ng Kongreso, naging 154.4 million sa GAA or General Appropriations Act for this year, Your Honor.

2865
03:25:46,820 --> 03:25:48,860
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kaya usually, ganoon ang practice po ng DBM.

2866
03:25:49,240 --> 03:25:54,840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tinitingnan lang nila yung NEP level. Hindi nila ina-appropriate for the succeeding year yung GAA level.

2867
03:25:55,720 --> 03:26:00,480
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Ang assumption nila, siguro, baka dadagdagan ulit po ng Kongreso.

2868
03:26:00,880 --> 03:26:08,000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, actually, this 2027 NEP increased by a little over a million from the NEP level of 2026, Your Honor.

2869
03:26:08,700 --> 03:26:18,180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Chair, Mr. Secretary, alin po kayang mga activities or communities or learners groups ang pinakatatamaan ng pagbawas na ito?

2870
03:26:18,180 --> 03:26:23,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung sakaling hindi po ito maibalik sa original na requested?

2871
03:26:24,600 --> 03:26:25,180
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Well, yung support.

2872
03:26:25,720 --> 03:26:28,660
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Support funds for the delivery of the IPED program.

2873
03:26:29,040 --> 03:26:35,560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We can cover 4,471 more schools, Your Honor, pagka nabigay po yung additional funding.

2874
03:26:36,200 --> 03:26:40,160
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tapos yung learning and development for learning delivery, translanguaging training.

2875
03:26:40,960 --> 03:26:42,100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pangalawang batch na po yun.

2876
03:26:42,740 --> 03:26:48,900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tapos merong policies and standards for interagency agreements to address the access concerns of our IP learners, Your Honor.

2877
03:26:49,360 --> 03:26:50,880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yun yung mga tatamaan po.

2878
03:26:51,820 --> 03:26:55,660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Chair, Mr. Secretary, ito yung mahalaga po sa akin.

2879
03:26:55,720 --> 03:27:07,260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dahil particular na ako po ay isang indigenous people at karamihan po ng aking mga kababayan, mga constituents na IP ay lumalapit patungkol po dito.

2880
03:27:07,520 --> 03:27:12,740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya nababahala po ako kung ito po ay hindi mai-increase, Madam Chair.

2881
03:27:13,240 --> 03:27:21,560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa 76 million na allocation, ilan po kayang indigenous communities at learners lang po ang kayang masuportahan ng DEPED dito?

2882
03:27:21,560 --> 03:27:25,700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ano po kaya ang critical unmet needs?

2883
03:27:25,720 --> 03:27:29,420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na hindi na matutugunan sa ganitong level ng pondo po?

2884
03:27:30,520 --> 03:27:38,620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Ang masaserve po natin ay 560,700 learners and 4,400 schools.

2885
03:27:39,140 --> 03:27:50,340
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tapos pag nadagdagan po yung hinihingi ng 78 million, which is to bring it up to 2026 level, ganoon din po yung number of schools na masisilbihan, Your Honor.

2886
03:27:50,660 --> 03:27:52,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Madam Chair.

2887
03:27:52,140 --> 03:27:55,140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano pong resources ang nakalaan para sa culturally?

2888
03:27:55,720 --> 03:28:09,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: The responsive learning materials, active community participation, paggamit ng indigenous languages, at pagpapatayo o pagpapanatili ng learning spaces para sa mga IP learners.

2889
03:28:10,240 --> 03:28:14,840
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Well, that's all part of the localization of the curriculum, Your Honor.

2890
03:28:15,240 --> 03:28:19,880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pinapayagan natin yung mga divisions at saka yung mga regions to give priority.

2891
03:28:19,880 --> 03:28:25,020
